            "value" : "Der Krater hat sich mit Wasser gefüllt. Die goldenen Risse erinnern daran, dass du neu begonnen hast."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The crater has filled with water. The gold cracks remember that you started again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El cráter se ha llenado de agua. Las grietas de oro recuerdan que has vuelto a empezar."
